  "logo": "https://cdn.uppromote.com/storage/uploads/logo/1744703845_7824493_6a717b1c461be5b6dd3f13f9dccb369e.png",
  "description": "<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong></strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Product Description</strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><strong>License Plate Safe</strong>&nbsp;is your new secret stash box for your vehicle. The patent-pending design doubles as an anti-theft license plate frame and hidden locked storage box for your keys, cash, credit cards, or other valuables.<br><br>It is the perfect solution when you don't want to take your keys while surfing, hiking, or enjoying other outdoor activities.&nbsp; It is also a smart solution for contactless car sharing.&nbsp; License Plate Safe installs in minutes using the same spot as your license plate.&nbsp; Then just slide your plate into the frame door and lock it up using the 4-digit combination lock.<br><br>Also includes a RFID blocking faraday pouch for your key FOB.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>USP (Unique Selling Point)</strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">The idea for License Plate Safe started by wanting a better way to hide our car key when surfing. We didn&rsquo;t like traditional hide-a-key magnets or lockboxes which have to hang on the car window or door handle. It was clear others felt the same way. Use it for all your outdoor adventures where you want to leave your keys behind or as a solution for contactless car sharing.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><strong>Payment terms:</strong> 30 days after Sale<br><br></p>",
